sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Browser
  participant P1 as Client
  participant P2 as Auth server
  participant P3 as Resource API
  P1->>P0: Start bound authorization request
  P0->>P2: Authorize with code challenge
  P2->>P0: Redirect with short-lived code
  P0->>P1: Deliver code and bound state
  P1->>P2: Exchange code plus verifier
  P2->>P1: Audience-specific tokens
  P1->>P3: Access token
  P3->>P1: Authorized resource
